      "@id": "kt:free-cash-flow",
      "@type": "kto:Metric",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Free Cash Flow",
      "skos:definition": "A cash-based performance and liquidity measure, usually computed as cash flow from operating activities minus capital expenditures, that shows how much cash a business generates after funding the investment needed to sustain and grow its operations.",
