      "@id": "kt:balanced-scorecard",
      "@type": "kto:Framework",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Balanced Scorecard",
      "skos:definition": "A strategic performance-management framework, introduced by Robert S. Kaplan and David P. Norton in 1992, that complements financial results with customer, internal-process and learning-and-growth measures so that managers can track whether strategy is being executed and what will drive future financial performance.",
